'' 'match' (docs/tiko-comparison RFC-0001-match): what the desugaring refuses, one each. TKO1240
'' an empty match; 1242 'case' arms in a value; 1243 '=>' arms in a statement; 1244 'else' not
'' last; 1245 a match expression as a loop condition; 1246 a malformed pattern; 1247 a name bound
'' twice; 1248 a pattern list that binds; 1249 a guard on 'else'.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/match-shape.tiko
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: match-shape.tiko(3,1): error TKO1240: 'match' needs at least one arm
'' EXPECT-OUT: match-shape.tiko(6,5): error TKO1242: a 'match' used as a value takes 'pattern => value' arms, not 'case'
'' EXPECT-OUT: match-shape.tiko(9,5): error TKO1243: a 'match' statement takes 'case' arms
'' EXPECT-OUT: match-shape.tiko(12,5): error TKO1244: 'else' must be the last arm of a 'match'
'' EXPECT-OUT: match-shape.tiko(15,10): error TKO1245: a 'match' expression cannot be used in a loop condition
'' EXPECT-OUT: match-shape.tiko(22,10): error TKO1246: malformed 'match' pattern: 'is' needs a relational operator
'' EXPECT-OUT: match-shape.tiko(30,5): error TKO1247: 'a' is bound twice in one pattern
'' EXPECT-OUT: match-shape.tiko(34,5): error TKO1248: a pattern list ('a, b') cannot bind names
'' EXPECT-OUT: match-shape.tiko(39,5): error TKO1249: an 'else' arm cannot have a guard
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 9
